Field Type Required Used for <code>variantId</code> string, <code>gid://shopify/ProductVariant/&lt;n&gt;</code> ✅ The real child SKU this option maps to. <code>label</code> string ⛔ Human-readable dropdown option label (e.g. <code>"Black"</code>). Falls back to the raw variant GID if omitted. Buyer-facing. <code>listPrice</code> decimal string ✅ Same purpose as <code>components[].listPrice</code> — pricing weight, not customer-facing. <p>Example slot:</p> <pre><code>{
  "role": "sweater",
  "quantity": 1,
  "title": "Choose your sweater",
  "allowedVariants": [
    { "variantId": "gid://shopify/ProductVariant/…SweaterBlack", "label": "Black", "listPrice": "110.00" },
    { "variantId": "gid://shopify/ProductVariant/…SweaterBlue",  "label": "Blue",  "listPrice": "110.00" }
  ]
}
</code></pre>
